ice=device)\r\n      4     print(a)\r\n      5 get_device()\r\n\r\nRuntimeError: p INTERNAL ASSERT FAILED at C:\\w\\1\\s\\windows\\pytorch\\c10/core/impl/DeviceGuardImplInterface.h:213, please report a bug to PyTorch. DeviceGuardImpl for msnpu is not available\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\n\r\n<!-- A clear and concise description of what you expected to happen. -->\r\n\r\nIt ought have thrown something like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\nRuntimeError: CUDA error: invalid device ordinal\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n```\r\nCollecting environment information...\r\nPyTorch version: 1.3.0\r\nIs debug build: No\r\nCUDA used to build PyTorch: 10.1\r\n\r\nOS: Microsoft Windows 10 Pro\r\nGCC version: (tdm64-1) 4.9.2\r\nCMake version: Could not collect\r\n\r\nPython version: 3.7\r\nIs CUDA available: Yes\r\nCUDA runtime version: 10.1.243\r\nGPU models and configuration: GPU 0: GeForce GTX 950M\r\nNvidia driver version: 431.60\r\ncuDNN version: Could not collect\r\n\r\nVersions of relevant libraries:\r\n[pip3] numpy==1.16.5\r\n[pip3] torch==1.3.0\r\n[conda] Could not collect\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Additional context\r\n\r\nN/A\r\n\r\n<!-- Add any other context about the problem here. -->\r\n\n\ncc @ezyang @gchanan @zou3519","closed_by":{"login":"facebook-github-bot","id":6422482,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjI0ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6422482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/facebook-github-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook-github-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/facebook-github-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/facebook-github-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/facebook-github-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/facebook-github-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/facebook-github-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/facebook-github-bo